      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIWI LISMORE (3) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and tried to lead throughout but run over late when fourth (30.31) at this track over 525m. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Looks the one to beat on her best form. ILLUMINATOR (2) has a strong record this journey here with three wins and a minor from eight starts. Recorded a 3 length win (27.21) in a Grade 5 FIN last time at Horsham. Can feature in the finish. ZIPPING KIMELI (6) showed strong early pace and stuck on well despite finishing out of the placings when fifth over 525m this track in 30.32. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Better than last start and can bounce back. REGAL SPENCER (1) can measure up with the right run.",
